on\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:13df2a48-8332-4752-b5f7-b7ef69e2155c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:13df2a48-8332-4752-b5f7-b7ef69e2155c\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Apothecary%27s_Cellar\" title=\"Apothecary's Cellar\">Apothecary's Cellar</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-667&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-356</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[You turn page after page filled with strange alchemical sketches and formulae. Some are written plainly, some in runes and scripts you barely recognise.\n</p><p><br>\nThere are guides to transmutating metals and recipes for weapons of war, but more than anything else, the book is concerned with reanimating dead flesh.]\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715070542\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.051 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1608/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 28252/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6763/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 928511/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   42.195      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   42.195      1 -total\n 56.54%   23.859      7 Template:Icon_text\n 49.10%   20.